  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergy - Development of a wind power plant in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The agreement is part of Norad&apos;s Nansen Support Programme for Ukraine, specifically under the business support scheme. Norad&apos;s support helps mitigate Emergy&apos;s risks in developing a273 MW wind project in Ukraine.

The support includes funding for technical, environmental, and social studies, as well as environmental and social mapping and grid connection studies. This assistance aims to make the project bankable.

The primary beneficiaries of this initiative are the people of Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
